{"id":"53f8ac731ffeb567","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity.md","title":"函数成员关系不对输入域的原始包含单调","display":"ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity — 函数成员关系不对输入域的原始包含单调","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity","aliases":["72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity"],"display":"ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity — 函数成员关系不对输入域的原始包含单调","depends_on":["[[72-df-dependent-function-per]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9 half-positive definition warning, print748/PDF760; explicit local counterexample","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity — 函数成员关系不对输入域的原始包含单调"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6318833c3cb4f67\" href=\"?note=b6318833c3cb4f67\" title=\"72-df-dependent-function-per\">72-df-dependent-function-per</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9 half-positive definition warning, print748/PDF760; explicit local counterexample"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(T:=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}\">\\(\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lam}:=T\">\\(\\mathsf{Lam}:=T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T\\)</span> 为恒1函数。α、β 及 Φ 由下式给出，Π 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6318833c3cb4f67\" href=\"?note=b6318833c3cb4f67\" title=\"72-df-dependent-function-per\">72-df-dependent-function-per</a> 的抽象接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\alpha_1:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\quad\\beta:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\quad\n\\Phi_i:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha_i|\\}\\quad(i&lt;2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_0:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\alpha_1:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\quad\\beta:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\quad\n\\Phi_i:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha_i|\\}\\quad(i&lt;2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0\\subseteq\\alpha_1,\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha_0,\\Phi_0)=T^2,\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha_1,\\Phi_1)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_0\\subseteq\\alpha_1,\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha_0,\\Phi_0)=T^2,\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha_1,\\Phi_1)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空输入支撑使函数比较条件真空成立；加入输入0以后，所有应用返回1，而 (1,1) 不在 β，故没有任何相关函数。身份求值不改变关系。该反例说明直接以成员 PER 包含关系作统一单调递归会失败；原书因此使用类型系统扩张次序，对旧类型保持成员关系完全相同。这里的 app 是合法的抽象结构参数，不声称该二元素结构实现全部 λ 演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dependent-function-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T:=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}$，$\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$；$\\mathsf{Lam}:=T$，$\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T$ 为恒1函数。α、β 及 Φ 由下式给出，Π 使用 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]] 的抽象接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T:=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lam}:=T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_0:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\alpha_1:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\quad\\beta:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\quad\n\\Phi_i:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha_i|\\}\\quad(i<2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_0\\subseteq\\alpha_1,\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha_0,\\Phi_0)=T^2,\\qquad\n\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha_1,\\Phi_1)=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1997,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-572","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"}],"outgoing":["b6318833c3cb4f67"]}